{"t":"say","text":"For 15 developers, Qoder Teams is the right fit: it provides managed seats, SSO and usage analytics for your engineering team."}
{"t":"rec","product":"qoder-teams","fit":"primary","why":"Managed coding agent seats with SSO, privacy mode and admin analytics for a 15-person dev team."}
{"t":"rec","product":"token-plan","fit":"complement","why":"Per-member model credits so each developer can use Qwen inside their existing coding tools."}
{"t":"rec","product":"model-studio","fit":"complement","why":"Backend API that powers Qoder agents and Token Plan keys with hosted Qwen models."}
{"t":"done","summary":"Recommended Qoder Teams as the primary coding agent for 15 developers, complemented by Token Plan and Model Studio."}

{"t":"say","text":"For a team AI agent, Qoder Teams gives developers seats with SSO and analytics, while QwenWork serves the wider company."}
{"t":"rec","product":"qoder-teams","fit":"primary","why":"Team coding assistant with SSO, privacy mode, admin controls and usage analytics for engineering teams."}
{"t":"rec","product":"qwenwork","fit":"complement","why":"All-in-one workplace agent for docs, slides, sheets and web pages for non-developer teammates."}
{"t":"rec","product":"token-plan","fit":"complement","why":"Credit subscription so your team can use Qwen models inside coding tools they already have."}
{"t":"say","text":"Is your team mainly software engineers, or do you need an agent for the whole company?"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Recommended Qoder Teams for developer teams, with QwenWork and Token Plan as complements."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll protect your e-commerce site with ESA for DDoS defense, WAF and Captcha to block bots and credential stuffing."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","anti-ddos-proxy","alb","waf","captcha","ecs","rds"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Shoppers & Bots","group":"internet","why":"Visitors reaching the e-commerce site."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the shop domain to ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Caches content, provides built-in DDoS defense and bot management at the edge."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"ddos","product":"anti-ddos-proxy","label":"Anti-DDoS Proxy","group":"edge","why":"Scrubbing large volumetric DDoS attacks beyond ESA baseline protection."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-ddos","from":"esa","to":"ddos","label":"origin"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Shop VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes traffic to web servers across two zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF 3.0","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Blocks OWASP attacks, credential stuffing and malicious bots at the load balancer."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ddos-alb","from":"ddos","to":"alb","label":"clean"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"Web servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the e-commerce application in two zones."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"node","id":"captcha","product":"captcha","label":"Captcha","group":"sg","why":"Challenges suspicious sign-up and login requests to stop automated bots."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-captcha","from":"app","to":"captcha","label":"verify"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Orders DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores orders and user accounts with a zone standby."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"done","summary":"E-commerce protected by ESA, Anti-DDoS Proxy, ALB with WAF 3.0, Captcha for sign-ups, and a two-zone RDS backend."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll swap the ECS app servers for ACK, which scales node pools automatically."}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ack","label":"Store cluster","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs store pods on managed Kubernetes across two zones."}
{"t":"remove","id":"scaling"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Replaced ECS and Auto Scaling with a two-zone ACK cluster; all other edges stay intact."}

{"t":"say","text":"Mumbai (ap-south-1) is closed, so I'll place the servers in Singapore and use ESA to keep latency low for India."}
{"t":"req","text":"Low latency for users in India"}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","ecs","rds"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"India users","group":"internet","why":"End users in India accessing the application."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the domain to ESA edge nodes."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Accelerates traffic from India to Singapore with edge caching and routing."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"App VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Distributes incoming requests across two zones."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"App servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the application with high availability in two zones."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Database","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores application data with a standby in the second zone."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Singapore-hosted app behind ESA for low India latency, with ALB, ECS and RDS across two zones."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw an enterprise AI agent architecture using AgentCore for governance, AgentRun for serverless execution, and Model Studio for LLMs."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","alb","cloud-native-api-gateway","agentcore","agentrun","ai-gateway","model-studio","agent-sandbox","sls","ram","agent-security-center"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Enterprise users","group":"internet","why":"Staff interacting with agents via chat or UI."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the agent platform domain."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Agent VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Ingress load balancer for agent traffic."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-alb","from":"users","to":"alb","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"gateway","product":"cloud-native-api-gateway","label":"API Gateway","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Auth, rate limiting and routing to AgentCore."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-gateway","from":"alb","to":"gateway"}
{"t":"node","id":"agentcore","product":"agentcore","label":"AgentCore","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Governs agents: skills, MCP tools, human approval steps."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gateway-agentcore","from":"gateway","to":"agentcore"}
{"t":"node","id":"agentrun","product":"agentrun","label":"AgentRun","group":"sg","why":"Serverless runtime executing agent code and sandboxes."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agentcore-agentrun","from":"agentcore","to":"agentrun","label":"invoke"}
{"t":"node","id":"sandbox","product":"agent-sandbox","label":"Agent Sandbox","group":"sg","why":"Isolated environments for agent code and browser tasks."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agentrun-sandbox","from":"agentrun","to":"sandbox","label":"exec"}
{"t":"node","id":"ai-gw","product":"ai-gateway","label":"AI Gateway","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes LLM calls with fallback, token limits and caching."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agentcore-aigw","from":"agentcore","to":"ai-gw","label":"LLM"}
{"t":"node","id":"llm","product":"model-studio","label":"Model Studio","group":"sg","why":"Qwen models powering agent reasoning and tool use."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-aigw-llm","from":"ai-gw","to":"llm"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"SLS","group":"sg","why":"Collects agent traces, logs and audit events."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agentcore-logs","from":"agentcore","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agentrun-logs","from":"agentrun","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"ram","product":"ram","label":"RAM","group":null,"why":"Workload identities and policies for agent permissions."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agentcore-ram","from":"agentcore","to":"ram","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"asc","product":"agent-security-center","label":"Agent Security Center","group":null,"why":"Scans skills, enforces guardrails and red-teams agents."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agentcore-asc","from":"agentcore","to":"asc","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Enterprise AI agent platform with AgentCore governance, AgentRun execution, AI Gateway, Model Studio, sandboxes, logging and security."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a lean two-zone MVP: ESA for edge, ALB, a small ECS pair with Auto Scaling, Tair cache and RDS."}
{"t":"req","text":"Budget under $200 per month"}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","ecs","ess","tair","rds","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Users","group":"internet","why":"People signing up and using the web app."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the app domain to ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Caches static assets and accelerates dynamic requests."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"MVP VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes traffic across two zones cheaply."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"App servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the web app on small instances to save cost."}
{"t":"node","id":"scaling","product":"ess","label":"Auto Scaling","group":"vpc","attachTo":"app","why":"Scales down to one instance off-peak to stay under budget."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"say","text":"Sessions go to Tair and user data to RDS, both multi-zone for HA without extra nodes."}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores sessions in memory; smallest tier fits the budget."}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"User DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Holds accounts and app data with built-in standby."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-cache","from":"app","to":"cache"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Free-tier log collection for debugging the MVP."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Lean two-zone MVP under $200/mo: ESA, ALB, ECS with Auto Scaling, Tair cache and RDS."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll add Elasticsearch for full-text search on your listings. It runs multi-zone and syncs from RDS."}
{"t":"node","id":"search","product":"elasticsearch","label":"Listings search","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Full-text search index for listing queries across two zones."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-search","from":"app","to":"search","label":"query"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added multi-zone Elasticsearch for full-text listing search, queried by the app servers."}

{"t":"say","text":"Your compute, cache, database and search are already multi-zone. I'll add GTM for DNS failover."}
{"t":"node","id":"gtm","product":"gtm","label":"GTM","why":"DNS health checks and failover between zones or regions."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dns-gtm","from":"dns","to":"gtm","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gtm-esa","from":"gtm","to":"esa","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added GTM for DNS-level failover; all data-plane nodes were already multi-zone."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a serverless microservices backend using SAE (no Kubernetes needed), with API Gateway, RocketMQ for order events, Tair and RDS."}
{"t":"req","text":"Avoid Kubernetes; team has no K8s experience"}
{"t":"plan","products":["mobile-app","dns","esa","cloud-native-api-gateway","waf","sae","mse","rocketmq","tair","rds","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"mobile-app","label":"Food delivery app","group":"internet","why":"Customers placing orders from their phones."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the API domain to ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-dns","from":"app","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Accelerates REST API calls and provides DDoS defense."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-esa","from":"app","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Delivery VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"gw","product":"cloud-native-api-gateway","label":"API Gateway","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes REST APIs to the 12 microservices with auth."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"gw","why":"Protects APIs from injection and bot attacks."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-gw","from":"esa","to":"gw","label":"origin"}
{"t":"say","text":"SAE runs your 12 microservices as containers without any Kubernetes to manage. It scales automatically."}
{"t":"node","id":"svc","product":"sae","label":"Microservices (SAE)","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs 12 microservices serverlessly; auto-scales without K8s."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gw-svc","from":"gw","to":"svc","label":"REST"}
{"t":"node","id":"reg","product":"mse","label":"MSE Nacos","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Service discovery and config for the 12 microservices."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-svc-reg","from":"svc","to":"reg","kind":"control","label":"registry"}
{"t":"say","text":"Order events flow through RocketMQ so services stay decoupled. Tair caches menus, RDS stores orders."}
{"t":"node","id":"mq","product":"rocketmq","label":"RocketMQ","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Decouples order events between microservices asynchronously."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-svc-mq","from":"svc","to":"mq","label":"events","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Menu cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Caches menus and sessions for low-latency reads."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-svc-cache","from":"svc","to":"cache","label":"Redis"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Orders DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores orders and payments durably with HA standby."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-svc-db","from":"svc","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"img","product":"oss","label":"Food images","group":"sg","why":"Stores restaurant and dish photos served via ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-img","from":"esa","to":"img","label":"images"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralized logs and tracing for all microservices."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-svc-logs","from":"svc","to":"logs","kind":"control","label":"logs"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Serverless food-delivery backend on SAE with API Gateway, RocketMQ events, Tair cache and RDS, no Kubernetes required."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll add Auto Scaling to SAE (built-in, no K8s) and a read replica for the orders database to handle 5x traffic."}
{"t":"node","id":"svc","product":"sae","label":"Microservices (SAE)","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs 12 microservices; SAE auto-scales pods on CPU and request metrics without Kubernetes management."}
{"t":"node","id":"db-read","product":"rds","label":"Orders DB read replica","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Offloads read queries like order history lookups to absorb 5x traffic growth."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-svc-db-read","from":"svc","to":"db-read","label":"SQL reads"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added SAE auto-scaling note and an RDS read replica to handle 5x traffic growth without Kubernetes."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll add an AI dish assistant using Model Studio for Qwen models, connected to the microservices via a new edge."}
{"t":"node","id":"ai","product":"model-studio","label":"Dish AI assistant","group":"sg","why":"Qwen model answers customer questions about dishes and menus."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-svc-ai","from":"svc","to":"ai","label":"LLM"}
{"t":"done","summary":"changes: +ai(model-studio) +e-svc-ai"}

{"t":"say","text":"15명 개발 팀용 코딩 AI 에이전트로 Qoder Teams를 추천드립니다. 혹시 개발자 외에 다른 직군도 사용하나요?"}
{"t":"rec","product":"qoder-teams","fit":"primary","why":"15명 개발팀을 위한 SSO, 관리자 기능 및 프라이버시 모드가 포함된 코딩 에이전트입니다."}
{"t":"rec","product":"token-plan","fit":"complement","why":"Qoder Teams 멤버별 키로 Qwen 모델을 호출할 수 있는 크레딧 구독입니다."}
{"t":"rec","product":"model-studio","fit":"complement","why":"앱 백엔드에서 Qwen 모델 API를 호출해야 할 때 사용하는 서비스입니다."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a Singapore-hosted fintech customer portal with ESA, WAF, ALB, ECS, Tair, RDS and KMS for data encryption."}
