{"t":"say","text":"I'll add Cloud Backup for automated RDS and ECS backups, all staying in Singapore per your data residency rule."}
{"t":"node","id":"backup","product":"cloud-backup","label":"Cloud Backup","group":"sg","why":"Automated disaster recovery backups for databases and servers within Singapore."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-backup-db","from":"backup","to":"db","kind":"control"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-backup-app","from":"backup","to":"app","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added Cloud Backup with control edges to RDS and ECS for disaster recovery, keeping all data in Singapore."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll add an AI chatbot using Model Studio for LLM inference and Milvus as a vector store for RAG over your docs."}
{"t":"say","text":"All components stay in Singapore (ap-southeast-1) to meet your data residency requirement."}
